{"title": "Strider Movement", "pageid": 28482, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Strider_Movement", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Strider Movement</b> is a passive feature that increases the user's movement speed.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You gain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Longstrider_(Condition)\" title=\"Longstrider (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ad/Longstrider_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Longstrider_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ad/Longstrider_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Longstrider_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ad/Longstrider_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Longstrider_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Longstrider\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ad/Longstrider_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Longstrider_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ad/Longstrider_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Longstrider_(Condition)\" title=\"Longstrider (Condition)\">Longstrider</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Longstrider\"> Condition: Longstrider </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Longstrider_(Condition)\" title=\"Longstrider (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ad/Longstrider_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Longstrider_Condition_Icon.webp, /